{"candidateAnswer":"Pottery, rock climbing, cycling, baking, swimming","evidence":"[D1:11 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Sam: Nothing so far, but I was thinking about trying painting. Do you have any hobbies you love?\n[D2:10 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Sam: Thanks, Evan. Like you said, I've been looking for a hobby to stay motivated. I've been thinking about trying painting. Do you think it will help me de-stress?\n[D10:8 | 9:28 am on 11 September, 2023] Sam: Wow Evan, that's an awesome painting! Good on you for finding a way to de-stress. I could really use something like that - maybe I'll give painting a go or find another calming hobby.\n[D13:6 | 4:07 pm on 14 October, 2023] Sam: Thinking about trying something different outdoors. Any suggestions?\n[D13:8 | 4:07 pm on 14 October, 2023] Sam: Kayaking sounds awesome! Haven't tried it yet, but it looks like a fun way to get in some exercise and enjoy nature. I'm definitely considering giving it a try. Thanks!\n[D20:6 | 6:48 pm on 17 December, 2023] Sam: I used to love hiking, but it's been a while since I had the chance to do it.\n[D7:2 | 4:20 pm on 15 August, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan, sorry to hear about what happened. I can imagine how hard it must have been for you. Things haven't been easy for me either. Had a tough week and a doc's appointment, so it was kinda like a wake-up call to take better care of myself. On a bright side, I'm taking a cooking class to learn how to make healthier meals.\n[D7:4 | 4:20 pm on 15 August, 2023] Sam: The cooking class has been great, I've learned awesome recipes. Last night I made this yummy grilled dish, so good!\n[D7:6 | 4:20 pm on 15 August, 2023] Sam: Thanks, Evan! I marinated it with a few different ingredients and grilled it with some veggies. It turned out really flavorful! If you want, I can share more recipes from my cooking class. Just let me know what you're looking for!\n[D21:19 | 4:25 pm on 26 December, 2023] Sam: \nI do sketch occasionally, but I haven't created anything remarkable yet. I have a feeling I'll have something to show off before long! Seeing your passion for it is inspiring.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3c9a771e-d002-59e0-b0fa-8e39522abb37","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:5182d437d63e3afcef2de838ab5015498bd86d40c73dccd6d3c1af50b622e113","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What new hobbies did Sam consider trying?","referenceAnswer":"Painting, kayaking, hiking, cooking, running","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"5182d437d63e3afcef2de838ab5015498bd86d40c73dccd6d3c1af50b622e113"}}]}